     "content_html": "The trial centered on the issue of prayer in public schools."
    },
    {
     "id": 1172439,
     "content_html": "Clarence Darrow believed evolution should not be taught in schools."
    },
    {
     "id": 1172441,
     "content_html": "The trial debated whether evolution was a legitimate theory to be taught in schools."
    },
    {
     "id": 1172438,
     "content_html": "William Jennings Bryan was trying to get more publicity before his next attempt to become president."
    }
